cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software (or the teaching material it ships with), please cite it as below."
title: "nsF5 Steganography: syndrome matrix coding, wet-paper coding, blind steganalysis, and a bilingual teaching toolkit"
abstract: >-
  An open-source teaching and research toolkit for image steganography and
  steganalysis. It implements the nsF5 algorithm (binary Hamming syndrome
  matrix coding plus wet-paper coding), SHA-256 content keying, blind
  steganalysis (chi-square and RS analysis), and supervised detection with
  LightGBM, together with a bilingual handbook, ten runnable notebooks, an
  interactive browser laboratory, and a desktop GUI.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Yukinoshita-lin"
    alias: "Yukinoshita-lin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yukinoshita-lin/nsf5-steganography"
url: "https://github.com/Yukinoshita-lin/nsf5-steganography"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.7.1
date-released: 2026-09-15
